Khuti or Dhadha is worn in the ear in Chhattisgarh.

Things worn on the wrist are Patiya, Kakni, Haraiya, Bahuta, and Nagmori.

lurki is worn on the earlobe in Chhattisgarh. Ornaments worn on the ear in Chhattisgarh: Tittri, Lurki, Bari, Khuti, Dhadha, Eran, Karnaphool, Phundri.

Ornaments worn on the neck in Chhattisgarh: Sutiya, Sora, Hasli, Putli, Dholki, Tilak, Kantha.

Ornaments worn on the wrist or hand in Chhattisgarh: Patiya, Chudi, Kakni, Nagmori, Bahuta, Banrakhi.

Ornaments worn on the legs in Chhattisgarh: Paijana, Toda, Chhati, Bichhiya, Payal.

